            <ArticleTitle>Fetal Zika Virus Infection in Vietnam.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">ecurrents.outbreaks.1c8f631e0ef8cd7777d639eba48647fa</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1371/currents.outbreaks.1c8f631e0ef8cd7777d639eba48647fa</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>As of 13 July 2016, 13 countries have reported fetal Zika virus (ZIKV) infection. Here we report a case of fetal ZIKV infection that resulted from an infection originating in Vietnam.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
